# GRUB SHIFT: under VOLATILE every grub killed by an attack, a blast or
# sparks explodes in turn, so one shot can chain across the field.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat pods 2 2 1
cheat bug 3 2 1 0
cheat bug 4 2 1 0
cheat bug 5 2 1 0
cheat chip 6 32
cheat use 6 0 2
expect fx & 4
cheat use 5 2 2
expect kills == 3
expect status == 0
